# promise: #621
# A setup like the reporter's: two spaces, each on a profile of its own, and no space on Default. An
# extension's toolbar action runs in the space's own profile in both: the fixture opens a page with
# chrome.tabs.create, follows the tab it got back and answers in a tab of that space (GoFullPage does
# the same with its capture). Checked 20 Nov 2026 on main: both pass, no crash. This locks it while the
# reporter's crash log (an extension from the Web Store, possibly in one profile only) is awaited.
budget rss=900 stalls50=20
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
